OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer to fund former club's
OL,4,Asuicide campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite his recent departure, Vaulks
OL,7,Fsaid he would continue to fund the
OL,8,Fcampaign - for which he won the the
OL,9,FFifpro Players Voice award in 2025.
